              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nji etejo ninye, ‘Ore ti alo ina ng'ues e ong'uan, kelotu enkitoria e ong'uan enkop, naa kepaashari ninye too nkitoriat pooki, naa kemut ninye enkop, pooki, neituny, negiligil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 17.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore nena mowuarak tomon, ore ti atua ena kitoria neipang'u ilaiguanak tomon, naa kedumunye likae te siadi ninche; naa kepaashari ninye te kuldo le ndukuya, naa keiwuang'ie ninye ilaiguanak okuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.12.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 12.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.5+REV.13.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13.5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Keiro ninye mbaa naapaashare Ilo Otii Shumata Aisul, naa kelo ninye aitanaur lelo sinyat le Ilo Otii Shumata Aisul, nedamu pee eibelekeny nkatitin o nkitanapat; naa keishoori ninche aapik atuaenkaina enye te nkiti kata, nkatitin are o lpisiai le nkata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake keton enkiguana aiguana, ore enkitoo enye naa keyae aaitung'uaa ninye, pee eishieki neinyali aaiting'ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.20.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 20.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore enkitoria o enkitoo o engolon oo nkitoriat naatii abori shumata pooki, neishori iltung'ana loo sinyat le Ilo Otii Shumata Aisul; ore enkitoria enye naa keaku enkitoria oo ntarasi, ore enkitoo pooki neisiai nening ninche.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
