          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ene enkiting'oto e ina bae. Ore tialo nanu Daniel, aaitanyamala ndamunot aainei oleng, neibelekenya emua o sesen lai; kake atushuma ina bae too ndamunot aainei.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
